@host = http://localhost:5161
# Вставьте сюда accessToken из ответа на login
@token = 

### 1. Получить JWT
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "student", "password": "12345" }

### 2. Неверный пароль → 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "student", "password": "wrong" }

### 3. GET без токена → 200
GET {{host}}/api/tasks

### 4. GET по Id без токена → 200
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### 5. POST без токена → 401
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Без токена", "description": "", "isCompleted": false }

### 6. POST с JWT → 201 и createdBy
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title": "Сдать лабораторную", "description": "Модуль 06", "isCompleted": false }

### 7. DELETE с JWT → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Claims токена
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Изменённый токен (дописан лишний символ) → 401
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x
